        {
          "audio": "The second part is about where the Key is generally placed.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A clean 2D motion graphic environment with a white background. A stylized software window titled 'Project' is on the left, containing an 'src/' folder icon and a 'README.md' file. A purple speech bubble on the right side of the frame floats above a small code snippet box. The lighting is flat and even; colors are vibrant with a minimalist aesthetic.",
